graph TD
    %% DNA Damage Input
    A[UV Radiation or Chemical Damage] --> B[Bulky DNA Lesion Formation]
    B --> C[Helix Distortion]
    
    %% Pathway Choice
    C --> D{Damage Location<br/>and Context?}
    
    %% Global Genome NER Pathway
    D -->|Non-Transcribed| E[Global Genome Surveillance]
    E --> F[Rad4-Rad23 Complex Scanning]
    F --> G{Damage<br/>Detected?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Rad4-Rad23 Binds Lesion]
    H --> I[Damage Recognition]
    
    %% Transcription-Coupled NER Pathway
    D -->|Transcribed Gene| J[RNA Pol II Stalling]
    J --> K[Rad26 CSB Recruitment]
    K --> L[Rad26 Recognizes Stalled Pol II]
    L --> M[Transcription Complex Remodeling]
    M --> N[Damage Site Exposure]
    
    %% Convergence to Core NER
    I --> O[Rad14 XPA Recruitment]
    N --> O
    O --> P[TFIIH Complex Recruitment]
    
    P --> Q[Rad3 Helicase 5' to 3']
    P --> R[Rad25 SSL2 Helicase 3' to 5']
    
    Q --> S[DNA Unwinding]
    R --> S
    S --> T[Open Bubble Formation]
    T --> U[20-30 Nucleotide Bubble]
    
    %% Verification and Incision
    U --> V{Damage Confirmed<br/>in Bubble?}
    V -->|Yes| W[RPA Coating ssDNA]
    W --> X[Rad1-Rad10 Recruitment]
    X --> Y[Rad2 XPG Recruitment]
    
    Y --> ANDGATE1{Both Nucleases<br/>Positioned?}
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| Z[Dual Incision]
    
    %% 5' and 3' Incisions
    Z --> AA[Rad1-Rad10 5' Incision]
    Z --> AB[Rad2 3' Incision]
    
    AA --> AC[Damaged Oligonucleotide Release]
    AB --> AC
    AC --> AD[24-32 nt Gap in DNA]
    
    %% Gap Filling
    AD --> AE{Repair Synthesis<br/>Factors Ready?}
    AE --> ANDGATE2{Gap Present AND<br/>Pol δ/ε Available?}
    
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AF[PCNA Loading]
    AF --> AG[DNA Polymerase δ or ε]
    AG --> AH[Gap Filling Synthesis]
    AH --> AI[New DNA Strand]
    
    %% Ligation
    AI --> AJ{Nick Sealed?}
    AJ --> ANDGATE3{Synthesis Complete AND<br/>Ligase Available?}
    
    ANDGATE3 -->|Yes| AK[DNA Ligase I]
    AK --> AL[Nick Sealing]
    AL --> AM[Restored DNA Duplex]
    
    %% Outcomes
    AM --> AN[Repaired DNA]
    AN --> AO{In Transcribed<br/>Gene?}
    
    AO -->|Yes| AP[Transcription Resumption]
    AO -->|No| AQ[Genome Integrity Restored]
    
    AP --> AR[mRNA Synthesis Continues]
    AQ --> AS[Cell Cycle Progression]
    
    %% Failed Repair
    V -->|No| AT[Repair Aborted]
    AT --> AU[Checkpoint Activation]
    AU --> AV[Cell Cycle Arrest or Apoptosis]
    
